+"""RoboCasa365 <-> RLDX-1 observation / action IO.
+
+The RLinf RoboCasa365 env emits the SAME flat obs contract regardless of model
+(states[B,16], main/extra/wrist images[B,256,256,3], task_descriptions). Here we
+split it into the *nested* dict layout RLDX-1's native RLDXProcessor consumes
